<div class="mining-results-xlsx"
     style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #243746; padding: 36px 24px;">
  <div style="border-bottom: 3px solid #21856b; padding-bottom: 24px;">
    <p style="color: #21856b; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 12px;">
      CERTIFICATE OF ANALYSIS
    </p>
    <h1 name="coa_num" tal:content="options/name"
        style="font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.35; margin: 0; overflow-wrap: break-word;">
      COA ID
    </h1>
  </div>
  <div style="background: #f2f7f5; border-left: 4px solid #21856b; padding: 24px; margin-top: 32px;">
    <p style="color: #21856b; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 0 0 16px;">
      XLSX REPORT READY
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px;">
      An XLSX report of the results for the selected samples has been prepared.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;">
      You may email it to the client recipients, or save it in the client's Analysis Reports folder.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
